### 混合检索：过滤在融合与分页前执行，默认每页20条
# total为当前授权候选窗口数量；candidateLimitReached时提示缩小范围。
# conversationId不传是只读查询；传入则自动保存user/results，前端不要重复写消息。
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "知识检索 如何工作",
  "mode": "HYBRID",
  "knowledgeBaseIds": [1],
  "formats": [1, 2, 5, 6],
  "uploadedFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "uploadedTo": "2026-12-31T23:59:59",
  "pageNo": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "conversationId": 1
}

### 模糊检索：只做语义匹配，沿用该会话省略的过滤
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"查找相似主题", "mode":"FUZZY", "conversationId":1, "pageNo":2}

### 引导：最多两轮；每次query保持原问题，answer可为选项或自由输入
# 完成后search为真实混合结果，query为组合查询，state为本轮快照，供后续翻页沿用。
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/guide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":1,"query":"查找知识检索资料","answer":"操作步骤","skip":false,"modelId":1}

### 跳过剩余澄清，直接混合检索
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/guide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":1,"query":"查找知识检索资料","skip":true}

### 按命中分块预览原文与位置
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/preview?chunkId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 整份解析内容：PDF命中页、TXT/Markdown原文、Office全部解析分块与工作表
# source提供命中位置与授权下载地址；chunks按原文顺序返回全部解析内容。
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search/document-preview?chunkId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
